{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1482,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f7e3f7d682588114c74f530",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和妈妈打完电话后\n就变得很想见她了……啊~啊，\n要是有私人飞机就能马上见到了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc538cd3bdf9f06a169185ebb2ef4ad9b94e0f78baae2f19e60d006fd44d0d82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92d576b4ba15494c5e6475ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阳光暖暖的，真是约会的好天气啊♪\n要不去塔顶吃绝景午餐怎么样~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88bf40ec886db71cb4588826f98523a8361d0eababbf5d859798766610a68535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a11c9c4ad80353c2200d30cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏季集训我也会带上这身泳装哦！\n沙滩漫步，还有海边咖啡厅打卡，\n一起好好享受吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "da6a1ce060318d942973f17623d51a06977c2ae2e3cbcadd0fae2d41c8969e51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40803c06d2c35a8173575690",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天时我们家会经常\n一起去兜风赏红叶呢~\n爸爸开车时的样子真的很帅♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "85021468acfc26fad4b9e430a4a9a341c481c3ba13a344f047c4fc463b0680e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17a15fadc411d2baa3e4f4b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的度假村也很棒呢！\n在休息室边看雪边喝茶，\n简直棒到不行啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26d9aab062d18000b8eb8bbd6687f95510748592cd634849ad22e5bd3ecab3a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1477a49bbb97c4f1eb859ba9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我很喜欢蓝色，\n不过粉色也超可爱的啊。\n能让人变得悸动不已☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bbd2fb566d23e514f796af9e9803abab836fe4b303e6b28fe8fb7c2e2f7f8d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5fb8f4d4e221e49b8b1daee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说想做同款美甲，结果得到回复\n说“只做脚趾甲的话没问题”♪\n欸嘿嘿，像是骏逸亲会说的话呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c3723e8b878e7ff881f8d47630c1119dfa77f81ae2c9b3c4641cc8cbed06d8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32cf428ad429c84d5a622b88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是受到表扬就能成长的类型！\r\n要让我不断成长哦~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fd336ee5990e758d54b3813b08d5ab80aea558f0720dad68447dbf2889ed6ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac8ff45fb9b15bc0f4dc1aff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cca6b23a11354d81064b55655ba4a571b6f902dbe2c6b2ff8852bd9068bc51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dfd32d5490b4253760f7861",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练菜单，\r\n为我考虑了很多吧？\r\n让我看看让我看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f14ff0dba3766751ebd6793d5a139917aa7c819ca7744fa84a42fd1a452aa9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6ad53d9dd25ada8f0f0ac3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断成长中☆\r\n希望目光别从我身上离开呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0da965bcacbc3abad7fbe1e99a93f3e89346d4b2abb2161c0a22be9420e56dfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5218a81c3df415fd73a728bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐们也一定正在努力吧。\r\n我也不会输的~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c19e0c436fca2fb76f463d73e2fb50bf6806b2116295188af85e6d530daa631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c262e117b8bee0ac4cd7993",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的奖励会是什么呢~\r\n是开心的事？还是好吃的东西？\r\n我很期待，多多关照啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b34da454e278e8a8f6db421c00528d66a3f90a33ad3fa1797aff2ddabee26efa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:105e88b788a7b7592a983f68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个那个，训练结束后有预定吗？\r\n我想去看看衣服。\r\n拜托了，我想和训练员亲一起去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b4ad2875b8f04b8daf271b06a1c34e2c5ac4f1db331b2d573295a3cdc95d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc42a8686749925e7ec62218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去了迪拜后该做什么呢！\r\n参赛自然是不用说，\r\n也想享受两个人的私人时光呢♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "29136f336a2750a35bbfbf82f017d3aad9817098c521caa3d98429ca78424653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:535276a041e67ee10632607f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蓝色的大海，白色的沙滩！\r\n这样的景色就像在度假胜地一样，\r\n我太喜欢了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea85abea1b01937aea91f6a97d839861c94b73d46e23a1796f03a10759b600c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ff442920ee3244920fd6c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备OK！\n防晒霜也仔细涂上了哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "56d231351f5c36ca74d3ea7dc875097cb14ffba05d083f34564ea0355fe9704f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49ea680f7ec83ac418e8b64c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了享受上流的假期，\n现在得好好努力，对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "526940e7b0a6399b020725eb82e9df9d407796fc9e8b0fa4776f7ce194bd5e70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5878cfc89f9b17a4da44cdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的时候，\n也想尽量享受其中乐趣呢~☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d479f61c03f5c938c5a1278c5e11bdfdd9ad46d44c73590f2c3f3e4c82b6d915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2ef38a282aa582f6f899b21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐说锻炼精神也很重要……\n呜呜，铁球训练什么的\n还是不要啦~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "de2815e54402e2d3eec129262ac221f5f6272d3c1d82a168ec3172c0f73cfe69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b5d582671fea3bcbbd6acdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~呐~来制定一下今天训练后的\n安排吧！是去吃东西？\n还是去购物？该选哪个呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "231c90f9f6c74dd63e2ba25dfac13e392af3b3915cd9a3ef60e92b423b558e2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d241eb2e100a607bfdcec0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有很多地方想和训练员亲\n一起去呢！\n你会和我一起去的，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bb6345d054e7dc162f066c0c1217fd8fe436eb6badb7cb85b469e36c1dda15c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebac1762972798ffafe7ec16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲喜欢什么样的穿搭？\n可以的话我来帮训练员亲\n选一套合适的西装吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb776f62d85db15dbc81bb035de01a2858c65d1a864b74b7c5b4fbc725a159e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5af9339d08f19247a6f24cd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲喜欢什么样的穿搭？\n可以的话我来帮训练员亲\n选一套合适的礼服吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c98ad9d9f337f21922eb79c18c9dbaff3cc712e4c482ffa30d4cb7f44aec6f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:644146b3f80820016b3029ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害吧！\r\n已经变得这么闪耀了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0be88dfb2508738f121715539d468cbd86ddd87e6eba80703d77b4a4aa11932",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef163c80b02c7312c79c52f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲努力了，奖励你一朵小花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e73a9414766e4c019c85c3ce2530cbad43b76f2d541c472f37e1bd07a9fc30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e45c9eecc278ec92e2343cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起享受了最棒的假期呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5635e62a12eb8fcc0e803f558dd9ff0c9c01666973d0eab83522dca6660359e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:910639fda73f94a4358356a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是短暂却开心的旅程呢~☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2850bef6115b6d102d0d9aafae49cfdcf420f021174aaf4dd8c053de9d24fa1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:518021a35b8e59ba12de5a54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得更厉害了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f1643b977624337bc997a7a630078d4d06abec8324c77bd047a6f069e3f41c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86564c72ea86cc322ef15cec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "悸动停不下来了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb1fbe129b41f9ec7bc17ea4c6cfb7c027b678d55c2f8e3da013b2c3aef80e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c556240c495a2742d63eb12c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是强击！\r\n一起好好相处吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac40d8f92457fcecd88c01e1446206e2cd29ad404863157afaa0b18a0c929e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63a31d4e60522bbfd016307b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为闪闪发光的名流！\r\n和我一起悸动吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68da2898ecbe3e872b21884b37137c29c113ec894feeee21eac92f33e86d8ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c49e04dd33eeefa6925013d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会多多帮忙的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "69bb89a9e775aa3c63aa7e40dac93216ce37bfdcc6897425dc966271b0bdcb63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9698c03a58675d57355b5df2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种事我也能办到哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08811e02a2daf88b7cd849c899e5b53371bdbbdc97a911557169df158d2e8a36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4396cfa2efc27a3fca7c81af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名流等级，上升！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25dcf47ceffd919fe8f504f286aff576add8d9bfd8be516a1c95fd168cd8b1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df8a9a533d1d3f0a1b19222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更更更闪耀了哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdc5590f9b249f46123503260352d4a087d940aab0e506b6048430fc3127938",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4af934087e5de75a228921d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪闪发光的我变身☆\n一起好好享受假期吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "920aba012cd0a6a2897805236974928319685a7537fc4f1f32d66082ab417793",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e7cae817c839f87868ff686",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是强击哦！\n带着度假的心情出发吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f321bc396dff3247d1f2d5d052500cd5cee5bb1d82bfd2f5dc7a8fdd65ecdb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31507fb00ed56c4857ac2ec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始紧张了～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f57e4c0f62171346061d8dcfad68692d7e50cb694e73e6ce63fd32169eab3d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b2cc461de3a0e9258c24d31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的梦想真正开始，是在你选择了\n我的时候。…绝对要一起跑完全\n程，我已经这么决定了",
      "source_fingerprint": "db5928a26893988222962ff17d313aba53f2038a50c2b693dcdd806538cb3aa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869eaa12651adcb69c2bc704",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e034c489108d426004b6dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4c766384c4629dc337c0275",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕只有一个人，觉得我是特别的，\r\n就一定能成为主角。\r\n我现在就是这么相信的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db2fd10b733c1b848bb213c5e266822aea86c18363899d67cf1964a425470b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:337cbe0f6353e78e6994c90c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对这个人，我想了解更多！能\r\n产生这样的念头，原来很幸福啊……\r\n最近，我常常这么想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c961b9693f503c194e3f22584e67d0955e3aa2dfbf2578ee53d356734b7053",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9b9f4a300344c08c5ff1f77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您写新年试笔了吗？\r\n我写的是『主角』……不过每年\r\n都是同一个字呢……诶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a42cb2cd4f7a3eab1974b6077f43ccaa6cbf6d342a8316c47b7f7ace373089",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:796da4e4d178510b447e0066",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为做得有点过头成了牛奶加倍\r\n的巧克力……牛奶的分量，\r\n就当作心意的分量吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d97a7fca01ce1377dd33a8a5bb3a8f86de4b7d48f7faf1ab90dc2332f8e896",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2119e9083c373fd708554133",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "倾注真心做出的巧克力味道会变得特别……\r\n虽然我不知道是不是真有这种事\r\n……那个，这是我竭尽全力做出的……作品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e43f2f65f9bc2175af1b1c755dd44beabbfcb31501e00662961ce20ab764992a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd6c50674cf2d84462df1d21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼。帮大家把短笺挂好后\r\n就结束了……等等，啊啊！？\r\n我的愿望，忘记写了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dad0354236e669b8cbbd7b2dfa21fb2fc062fa2c227630171423914dde99364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4f260e3a40f6d5af354774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的～，大家每年都想得出各种\r\n恶作剧……希望今年我也能\r\n做出精彩的反应…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ad5de29172dc623bf2d3aa06ef618ac92e84f16387bee1fe08b966fbeea3000",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:927395cc02e8873e3740bc65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍的礼物交换会，每年都想当\n圣诞老人来着……可猜拳\n输了，今年又要当驯鹿了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a433d3cf9e9a65bed7b296a98ec6470f7eff47fbb5154ec9c9b94c63495399",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a62c7e856d0a886d9db0319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "选草莓奶油蛋糕，还是冻芝士蛋糕……\r\n小时候，我真的会为选哪一个\r\n认真烦恼……啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75ece269c982c502aa4465828871c2cbb7d268a0a7d520688d7d0383f528bb0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59a856ad5a68de2c3f475159",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也做到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98d5102fd7fee7dfa5ca9bc48cc7a5cb4573c85934ba80cfc8a95bcae0297450",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a25698f383a70ecc58eca52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～，大扫除，大扫除，继续干。\r\n宿舍走廊已经弄完了，接下来\r\n该把浴室打扫干净咯～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82c399189c72e53c5bffe1a37b49771c74743a2b6235b823036147c65b9ef3b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcae1292f15ddd6403237e3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日蛋糕，已经在推荐的店里\r\n预约好了。…也许庆祝方式\r\n太老套了……啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6030712700e6acfcc7aa13cc7afe43308bcab4bc60e9bda968cc9772eb489236",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79b98811d3986c1b1df3159",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日会的准备，已经做好了\r\n……为了让您真切地感受到，自己是主角，\r\n是特别的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11155ba7de77f76cf298bfc6ce880975a3e130583e4cbaa95294bc5a60cf3964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec7a2426059bd831ce2b1dbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从以前起，我就喜欢\r\n吹灭蛋糕蜡烛的那一刻。\r\n那会让我觉得自己才是主角！我很喜欢这种感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1ae16939be77c6c23791d4cab0ff5affc194e30ed509dd48df9f33fa75a9df8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93d451472df4dd73db5db80b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真不可思议啊。被训练员\r\n祝贺的时候……就会觉得自己\r\n是不是世界上最特别的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3006f6b40003c95b176771ff6e1bee5fbae90293983f54a8c006bd478f6d1080",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ca37e55bf3328484d02ac8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员有通知哦。\r\n啊，要是您忙的话，\r\n我可以代您看一下哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec0f11dd26d61c5a60232a386c9958775460fd6835acd63947b286cb18b90598",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:118c56305945ab8d0adf86e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物送到了呢。\r\n好期待啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e918defe21924da20783a96f21c80b258a0e91a86a334f2097775915d364626d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:212834709f0f8bf881afdd53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，已经有完成的任务了。\r\n真不愧是专业人士，厉害啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a5906d31909b8af9320f4bda23df45cf8e58f55836c31c41014b86c8f90a427",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d81d45d26a5d936c18b80bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像要举办活动了呢\r\n朋友好像也会参加，\r\n我也不能输啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ed4fb88078528019b8a1a64da9689eb42c44c80b64fa09cbc1772f7e3b29e58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa8162d21a379245dab1375a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办中哦。\r\n能不能当上主角要看表现……\r\n只能加油了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66bc59ece95c0dc852ededd14862b068f209be11e968400e5dc8eaec51af03f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80b315be811c3574e854ddbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然，还是不行吗…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92cfc1e379b9d571cf077c1c5d792676b8e200fa5a885b79331bc44e6ca125da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b5e5f5cf1789b6529052afa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23d755015d39ad870056f42adf9316239a21850556b828ebe7c06a0dc6c0410d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b02592814d7e22f6e03ad87a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢兜帽内侧的刺绣。\r\n看起来不起眼却暗藏惊艳\r\n的感觉，这一点，我也想学学",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8ad6b782c65bca1a82ffd380a5d851b6634caa8d11bce180c250ecaa9d7c46f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:202101f8fa590b8aa4678d7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外套可以在突然下雨时当伞用……\r\n也帮朋友挡过好几次雨呢，\r\n所以是件很可靠的衣服哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06da9b77272cbf162d66ca3950b07453fb9e4ee6a462ca033735036f416c7f1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8963610bad315d7da192c1aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "搭配虽然不算花哨\r\n但我想着项链一定要特别闪亮！怀着\r\n这个想法，我把零花钱都花在上面了",
      "source_fingerprint": "11377ebbd72c7c7529d0b06d876aca030e4980d071ca2397e238b5ace17c476c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f20e058cf29a6c616d428b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，好强…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "936b7cdf84f862a09214797cc4ecb03cd48c6ef7ecb9b879ca17e374af3023fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4157cfb5606a6b25a9263b95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都是主角呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efb3775be9af0b971113561bf91ef43c0200249bfa18a643dde4304b389ae75a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b99382b0257cdbb16418d7fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然，还是不行吗…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92cfc1e379b9d571cf077c1c5d792676b8e200fa5a885b79331bc44e6ca125da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cc0068de2415e5fd3fee806",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，好强…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "936b7cdf84f862a09214797cc4ecb03cd48c6ef7ecb9b879ca17e374af3023fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf69a40115a0917d806c3f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶诶！？真的！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc7ab4f426da60398ca27bf8777a89897d45c30d8440084ae62295ee640c415",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbd211f677185289815e3604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，一起加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f271104311b6a4f560215183e96f985902a8005901c389898a651f0a43bf6989",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ff8744e629315ad54c211d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:456f94ba9e2eaf0ac7a99606",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要训练吗？\r\n好！无论什么训练项目\r\n我都热烈欢迎！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4786ce93f19197de45385f890595b4cae304cfe054ff00a4f01b33d653ad7d55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641825ae5365687ac88aceff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园的历史啊。\r\n一定有非常多\r\n“主角”吧…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5eb939f791aab73ea2dc26456408cb40ed36f389a552d5b7566022b3108d64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f5ab115035d488be879645",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，是比赛吗？\r\n热身运动，我会先做好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ebe16b32a11765f6c4901d7443e5c6f1439fdb21b921eeef45caf960285af01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b8884459f6c0e83ae8a096",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会成为最引人注目的那个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ac1875d4dc1e6b33b1f4b42752dd6b33c1ccbfedd026b3c08240475974f891a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96f58adb9381a6ee47bbeba4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbf1caab2b1fa1a31712796f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇哇！？总，总觉得……好热！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d1ebb426bb5bb12640be9c98f19739878f510acd3ac807706c71a7ef702d41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "120000"
      ]
    }
  ]
